     job/hear

  +  vine
    :  w=writ

  +  take
    :  gift=axal[mode]

  +  hear
    :  changed=row[dep]
+  flue
  '  A linearized work unit: who caused it, where it lands, what it is.
  :  src=path dst=path job=job
+  bowl
  '  Per-activation context.  now is a logical clock, +1 per
  '  activation within the event; kids is the in-flight care-y view
  '  of the node's own subtree; crew holds the hydrated dependency
  '  views the node declared in its /sys/crew slot, keyed by their
  '  indexical slot names.
  :  src=path here=path now=nat eny=nat kids=axal[myth] crew=mop[path axal[myth] lt_pith]
+  yell
  '  What an arm returns: cards (path-tagged writs) to emit and the
