  +  vine
    :  p=path w=writ

  +  hear
    :  news=axal[row[dep]]
+  fate
  '  The kernel's answer: writes ordered by /lte_pith (tap order) and
  '  outbound effects.
  :  write=row[[p=path q=writ]] effects=row[move]
+  worm
  '  The per-event transaction.  down is a row+cursor queue (pop at
