+  guard_diffs
  '  The contract gate: every non-cull diff whose FINAL record
  '  carries a lash must fit it (/fit_check — the same predicate
  '  the standing queries scan with).  A write that carries
  '  ['sys 'lash] itself is exempt: adopting or amending a contract
  '  over legacy data must be possible, and the standing queries
  '  are how the nonconforming survivors get found.  (Dispatched
  '  talks write the whole melded record, so per-slot deltas are
  '  not distinguishable here — the final record is what is
  '  judged.)  One break rejects the whole event, so a transaction
  '  is contract-clean or absent, exactly like the tombstone rules.
